r body to provide energy throughout all of these activities. You get that boost of energy to put up that extra rep, but also improve your endurance through boosted phosphocreatine stores, allowing you to sustain higher intensities for longer while working cardio. <br></p><br><p>Finally, creatine is associated with better water retention in muscles, improving cellular hydration. This improves both function and appearance - who doesn't love getting a pump in the gym after a workout?</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="a1663b0e-0c16-43d6-866d-bcd2e9760c13" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-t46dro"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_CreatineBenefitsMap_WhiteBG_4_a5c5a9b8-b35f-46cb-b5b0-deaa2674153a.webp?v=1738701096&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_CreatineBenefitsMap_WhiteBG_4_a5c5a9b8-b35f-46cb-b5b0-deaa2674153a.webp?v=1738701096&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_CreatineBenefitsMap_WhiteBG_4_a5c5a9b8-b35f-46cb-b5b0-deaa2674153a.webp?v=1738701096&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_CreatineBenefitsMap_WhiteBG_4_a5c5a9b8-b35f-46cb-b5b0-deaa2674153a.webp?v=1738701096" alt="Circular diagram showing eight benefits of creatine, including increased energy and muscle growth." class="r-5a9am8" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="be025286-b544-464b-aad4-95ca8c8c80f0" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" class="r-7kkse9"><div data-rid="24f2c0e9-5132-42dd-8a6a-a50bc8fadbb5" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1pevw5y"><div data-rid="87d2caab-104e-4ba5-a736-d21d6e17ab54" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1hc1ox2"><div data-rid="50c6f209-0438-4088-82fe-46a3703ae5a2" dat